{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/vue/35_mitt/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>FilterBox.vue 의 데이터를<br>\nContainer.vue 를 넘어<br>\nApp.vue로 전송하기</p>\n<h2 id=\"mitt\" style=\"position:relative;\">mitt<a href=\"#mitt\" aria-label=\"mitt permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>mitt라는 라이브러리를 사용하면 원하는 컴포넌트로 데이터를 보내줄 수 있다.<br>\n부모 컴포넌트 뿐 아니래 형제 컴포넌트에게도 보낼 수 있다.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-설치\" style=\"position:relative;\">1. 설치<a href=\"#1-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98\" aria-label=\"1 설치 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"shell\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-shell line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-shell\"><span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> mitt\r\n// or\r\n<span class=\"token function\">sudo</span> <span class=\"token function\">npm</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> mitt\r\n// or\r\n<span class=\"token function\">yarn</span> <span class=\"token function\">add</span> mitt</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"2-mitt-라이브러리-셋팅\" style=\"position:relative;\">2. mitt 라이브러리 셋팅<a href=\"#2-mitt-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%8C%EB%9F%AC%EB%A6%AC-%EC%85%8B%ED%8C%85\" aria-label=\"2 mitt 라이브러리 셋팅 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"javascript\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-javascript line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-javascript\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>main<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>js<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> createApp <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'vue'</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> App <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'./App.vue'</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> mitt <span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"token string\">'mitt'</span>\r\n\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> emitter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">mitt</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>\r\n<span class=\"token keyword\">let</span> app <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token function\">createApp</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>App<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\r\napp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>config<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>globalProperties<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>emitter <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> emitter<span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span>  <span class=\"token comment\">// global value</span>\r\n\r\napp<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">mount</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string\">'#app'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"3-mitt로-데이터-전송\" style=\"position:relative;\">3. mitt로 데이터 전송<a href=\"#3-mitt%EB%A1%9C-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EC%A0%84%EC%86%A1\" aria-label=\"3 mitt로 데이터 전송 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>데이터를 보낼 컴포넌트에서 <code class=\"language-text\">this.emitter.emit()</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(FilterBox.vue)\r\n\r\n...\r\n&lt;button type=&quot;button&quot; @click=&quot;mittEvent&quot;&gt;버튼&lt;/button&gt;\r\n...\r\n\r\n...\r\n\r\n  methods: {\r\n    mittEvent(){\r\n      this.emitter.emit(&#39;이벤트명작명&#39;, &#39;데이터&#39;);\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n...</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"4-mitt-데이터-수신\" style=\"position:relative;\">4. mitt 데이터 수신<a href=\"#4-mitt-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EC%88%98%EC%8B%A0\" aria-label=\"4 mitt 데이터 수신 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>데이터를 받을 컴포넌트에서 <code class=\"language-text\">this.emitter.on()</code></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(App.vue)\r\n\r\n...\r\n  mounted(){\r\n    this.emitter.on(&#39;이벤트명작명&#39;, (a)=&gt;{\r\n      console.log(a);\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n...</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>보내고 받을 데이터가 많아지면 데이터 관리가 힘들기 때문에 Vuex를 많이 쓴다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"숙제\" style=\"position:relative;\">@숙제<a href=\"#%EC%88%99%EC%A0%9C\" aria-label=\"숙제 permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(FilterBox.vue)\r\n\r\n&lt;template&gt;\r\n  &lt;div @click=&quot;mittEvent&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;div class=&quot;filter-item&quot; :class=&quot;`${filter}`&quot; :style=&quot;{ backgroundImage : `url(${uploadImage})` }&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n    &lt;p class=&quot;filter-name&quot;&gt;&lt;slot&gt;&lt;/slot&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n&lt;/template&gt;\r\n\r\n...\r\n  methods: {\r\n    mittEvent(){\r\n      this.emitter.emit(&#39;FilterName&#39;, this.filter);\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n...</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(App.vue)\r\n\r\n...\r\n  mounted(){\r\n    this.emitter.on(&#39;FilterName&#39;, (a)=&gt;{\r\n      this.SelectFilter = a;\r\n      console.log(this.SelectFilter);\r\n    });\r\n  }\r\n...\r\n\r\n\r\n// 데이터에 SelectFilter 추가\r\n...\r\n  data(){\r\n    return {\r\n      post : post,\r\n      get: 0,\r\n      tab: 0,\r\n      uploadImage: &#39;&#39;,\r\n      uploadText: &#39;&#39;,\r\n      SelectFilter: &#39;&#39;,\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n...\r\n\r\n\r\n// publish 메소드에 filter 항목 수정\r\n...\r\n  methods: {\r\n    publish(){\r\n      const newPost = {\r\n        name: &quot;aluvy&quot;,\r\n        userImage: &quot;./img/profile1.jpg&quot;,\r\n        postImage: this.uploadImage,\r\n        likes: 0,\r\n        date: &quot;May 15&quot;,\r\n        liked: false,\r\n        content: this.uploadText,\r\n        filter: this.SelectFilter,\r\n      };\r\n      this.post.unshift(newPost);\r\n      this.tab = 0;\r\n    },\r\n  }\r\n...\r\n\r\n\r\n// container 컴포넌트에 SelectFilter props 전송\r\n...\r\n&lt;Container :post=&quot;post&quot; :tab=&quot;tab&quot; :SelectFilter=&quot;SelectFilter&quot; :uploadImage=&quot;uploadImage&quot; @write=&quot; n =&gt; uploadText = n &quot; /&gt;\r\n...</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<p>Container.vue 컴포넌트에서 SelectFilter props 받아서 class로 넣어주기</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"vue\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-vue line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-vue\">(Container.vue)\r\n...\r\n  &lt;div v-if=&quot;tab==1&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;div class=&quot;filter&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;div class=&quot;upload-image&quot; :class=&quot;`${SelectFilter}`&quot; :style=&quot;{ backgroundImage : `url(${uploadImage})` }&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n        &lt;div class=&quot;filters&quot;&gt;\r\n          &lt;ul&gt;\r\n              &lt;li class=&quot;filter-1&quot; v-for=&quot;(a,i) in filter&quot; :key=&quot;i&quot;&gt;\r\n                &lt;FilterBox :uploadImage=&quot;uploadImage&quot; :filter=&quot;a&quot;&gt;{{ a }}&lt;/FilterBox&gt;\r\n              &lt;/li&gt;\r\n          &lt;/ul&gt;\r\n        &lt;/div&gt;\r\n    &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  \r\n  &lt;div v-if=&quot;tab==2&quot;&gt;\r\n    &lt;div class=&quot;writer&quot;&gt;\r\n        &lt;div class=&quot;upload-image&quot; :class=&quot;`${SelectFilter}`&quot; :style=&quot;{ backgroundImage : `url(${uploadImage})` }&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\r\n        &lt;div class=&quot;write&quot;&gt;\r\n            &lt;textarea class=&quot;write-box&quot; @input=&quot;sendText&quot;&gt;write!&lt;/textarea&gt;\r\n        &lt;/div&gt;\r\n    &lt;/div&gt;\r\n  &lt;/div&gt;\r\n...\r\n\r\n\r\n...\r\n  props: {\r\n    post: Object,\r\n    tab: Number,\r\n    uploadImage: String,\r\n    SelectFilter: String,\r\n  },\r\n...</code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#mitt\">mitt</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#1-%EC%84%A4%EC%B9%98\">1. 설치</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#2-mitt-%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%EB%B8%8C%EB%9F%AC%EB%A6%AC-%EC%85%8B%ED%8C%85\">2. mitt 라이브러리 셋팅</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#3-mitt%EB%A1%9C-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EC%A0%84%EC%86%A1\">3. mitt로 데이터 전송</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#4-mitt-%EB%8D%B0%EC%9D%B4%ED%84%B0-%EC%88%98%EC%8B%A0\">4. mitt 데이터 수신</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#%EC%88%99%EC%A0%9C\">@숙제</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 2, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"35. 원하는 컴포넌트에 데이터 전송 mitt","summary":"FilterBox.vue 의 데이터를 Container.vue 를 넘어 App.vue로 전송하기 mitt mitt라는 라이브러리를 사용하면 원하는 컴포넌트로 데이터를 보내줄 수 있다. 부모 컴포넌트 뿐 아니래 형제 컴포넌트에게도 보낼 수 있다. 1. 설치 npm install mitt sudo npm install mitt","date":"Jun 28, 2023","categories":["VUE"],"tags":[],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/vue/35_mitt/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/vue/34_slot_props/","title":"34. slot props"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/vue/36_vuex/","title":"36. Vuex"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}